Package: liteadmin-apikeys
Version: __VERSION__
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: liteadmin (>= 0.3.0), php-cli
Maintainer: Martijn de Boer <git@sexybiggetje.nl>
Homepage: https://github.com/martijndeb/liteadmin
Description: API key management plugin for LiteAdmin
 Adds a plugin to LiteAdmin that issues and manages API keys with read/write
 scopes. It publishes the "apikey" auth guard and the "apikeys" service so
 other LiteAdmin plugins (REST API, MCP server, ...) can require a valid key.
